## Staying current with the commons

This repository can pull future improvements from the Golden Records
commons (clarified policy language, new compliance checklists, corrected
boilerplate) without losing your own customizations:

```
cd path/to/this/repo
copier update --trust
```

`copier update` performs a 3-way merge between the version of the commons
template you last rendered, the current commons template, and your
repository's current (possibly customized) state. Read the commons'
`docs/UPGRADE-GUIDE.md` before your first run — there is an important
gotcha about running `copier update` on a dirty working tree. The
`{{ _copier_conf.answers_file }}` file in this repository's root records
exactly what was answered and which template version was used; `copier
update` relies on it and it should not be edited by hand.

